emand from the activated network,\n- No facility\u2019s capacity is exceeded,\n- All company policies above are satisfied, and\n- The combined total of facility activation costs and transportation spend is minimized.\n\nWorking Approach\n- Use the annexed coordinates to determine distances between candidate facilities and customers and apply the per\u2011kilometer, per\u2011unit transport rate to estimate lane costs.\n- Evaluate alternative activation portfolios and shipment assignments that meet all demand and capacity limits, satisfy the minimum\u2011throughput rule, respect the F3\u2013F5 dependency, and stay within the $693 capital budget.\n- Recommend the configuration that achieves the lowest total landed cost while adhering to the policies and data provided.\n\nNext Steps\n- Confirm the data inputs in the annex.\n- Run the network evaluation under the policies above.\n- Review the resulting activation set, customer allocations, and cost breakdown with leadership for approval.\n\nAnnex: Data Inputs\n- Candidate facility coordinates: {FACILITY_COORDINATES}\n- Customer coordinates: {CUSTOMER_COORDINATES}\n- Facility capacities (units): {FACILITY_CAPACITIES}\n- Customer demand forecasts (units): {CUSTOMER_DEMANDS}\n- Facility activation fixed costs (currency): {FIXED_COSTS}\n- Transportation rate per km per unit: {TRANSPORT_RATE}"
